	The area of universal embedding of the augmented neural DDE architecture $\textup{NDDE}_{\tau,\textup{A}}^k(\mathcal{X},\mathbb{R}^q)$, $\mathcal{X}\subset \mathbb{R}^n$, $k \geq 0$ in dimension $m \geq p+q$ is given by
