		\label{eq:Z3}\mathcal{Z}_3 & \coloneqq \tilde{\lambda}^{-1}_i\left((\Psi_i(p)+r_0^2-\eps,\Psi_i(p)+r_0^2+\eps)\right) \subset \mathbb{R}^m.
