Table \ref{tab:summary} presents a summary of the results obtained from comparing the default Qiskit gate implementation and the $17.8$ $ns$ square pulse. The table showcases the maximum word length supported by each implementation while considering predefined error thresholds of 10\% and 20\% in absolute error.

