% \cred 
% Our design is motivated by \cite{ying2016information, salami2017social}. In \cite{ying2016information}, they study the limiting behavior of agents over a weakly connected network where certain receiving networks obtain information from sending networks without any reciprocal links. They demonstrate that the limiting behavior of the receiving networks is determined entirely by the sending networks, even under minimal information flow from the senders to the receivers. Therefore, it's possible to obtain a good estimate $\boldsymbol{y}_{k, i}$ through \eqref{eq:cross_combine}.
