Agents 1 and 4 are the actual players involved in the market, therefore they can naturally observe each other's strategies through the market (i.e., agent 1 and 4 can observe $\boldsymbol{y}_{4,i}$ and $\boldsymbol{x}_{1,i}$, respectively). 
