	These graphs together resemble the original layout graphs, with intersections of solid and dashed lines corresponding to data qubit locations.



For surface codes, variable nodes connected to only one check node in the layout graph are appended with virtual check nodes, as indicated by dotted boxes   in  Figure\,\ref{fig:decoding_d4}~(a).








