    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.8\linewidth]{figures/snake-sc-d5-stringop.pdf}
    \caption{Surface code snake merged with a logical ancilla patch on the left and a folded surface code logical patch on the right. 
    The arrow indicates the fold.
    Each logical patch has distance $d=5$. 
