    The product of $Z$ stabilizers to consider for the $Z_LZ_L$ measurement (supported on qubits with orange dots) are marked with asterisks. An $X$ bare logical and the corresponding gauge operators are shown by the blue dotted line and stars following the same logic as in~\autoref{fig:cc-snake}.}
    \label{fig:fsc-snake}
