Both PX4 and ArduPilot offer flexible parameter settings to match the vehicle’s physical dimensions, motor characteristics, and sensor inputs. Below are key parameters we configured to ensure stable autonomous operation:

\subsubsection{Steering Angle Limits}

\begin{itemize}
    \item ArduPilot: Adjusted \texttt{SERVOx\_MIN} and \texttt{SERVOx\_MAX} to accommodate the travel range of upgraded steering linkages.
