\caption{Decomposition of a non-unitary effective channel $\mathcal{E}_s$ into a unitary channel $U$ on a system-meter hybrid, where the meter is initialized into $\ket{\phi}$ and the meter measurement result is postselected onto string $\ket{s}$.}
\label{fig:non-unitary-decomposition}
