For this \lstinline{UniTensor}, there are 4 valid blocks that carry zero-flux and thus can have non-zero elements that do not break the symmetry. \Cref{fig:blocks} shows the block structure and the corresponding quantum numbers for each block. We can use \lstinline{UniTensor.print_blocks} to see all the blocks and their corresponding quantum numbers:
