In the case when the \gls{cpu} does not have any prior information of the sufficient statistics, the \gls{cpu} implements the \gls{mvu} estimator
\begin{comment}
\begin{equation}\label{eqn:LSestimatSuffStats}
	\widehat{\bar{\mathbf{x}}}_t^{(i)} =\left({\rho_{\rm c}^{(i)}}\right)^{-0.5}\mathbf{z}_t^{(i)},
\end{equation}
