where $\mathbf{C}^{(1)}$ is given in \eqref{eqn:mu1C1stats} \colr{ and is a diagonal matrix. This implies that the error covariance matrix in \eqref{errcov_p1} is also diagonal with its $(n',n')$-th entry given by 
